diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 48f8915..d93f73b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -81,6 +81,9 @@ Base URL: `https://your-auth-service.vercel.app/api/v1/auth`.
 | GET    | `/me`              | `Authorization: Bearer <access_token>`                                                                                                                                                          |
 | POST   | `/refresh`         | `{ "refresh_token": "..." }`                                                                                                                                                                    |
 | POST   | `/sign-out`        | `{ "access_token": "...", "refresh_token": "..." }`                                                                                                                                             |
+| POST   | `/change-password`  | Access and refresh tokens, `current_password`, `new_password`, optional `nonce`                                                                                                            |
+| POST   | `/reauthenticate`   | Access and refresh tokens; sends a verification code when secure password change requires it                                                                                             |
+| POST   | `/update-profile`   | Access and refresh tokens, `display_name`                                                                                                                                                 |
 
 POST bodies must be JSON and no larger than 16 KB. Sign-up passwords must be 8–128 characters; Supabase can enforce stricter rules. Sign-in accepts existing shorter passwords. Unknown fields are rejected.
 
